<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Air prelim 96 group pretax 180 mln.</title>
<headline>Austrian Air prelim 96 group pretax 180 mln.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading carrier Austrian air on Monday reported preliminary group pre-tax profit for 1996 at 180 million schillings, compared with 64.9 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
